# EduTrack — Sports & Activities Management Module
### Component Summary for Progress 1 Presentation

---

## 1. Overview

The **Sports & Activities Management** module is the core component of the **EduTrack** school management system. It provides a full, end-to-end digital workflow for managing a school's extracurricular activities — covering everything from registering a student into a sports team to generating attendance reports reviewed and approved by the principal, with automated teacher notifications.

**Tech Stack:**
| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React (Vite) + TypeScript + TailwindCSS + TanStack Query |
| Backend | Node.js + Express + TypeScript |
| Database | MySQL (via `mysql2` connection pool) |
| Auth | Header-based role middleware (`x-user-id`, `x-user-role`) |

---

