## 3. User Roles & Permissions

The system supports **5 user roles** with distinct access levels:

| Role | Key Permissions |
|---|---|
| **Admin** | Full access — create/delete activities, manage all data |
| **Coach** | Create activities, register students, create practice sessions, mark attendance, generate & submit reports |
| **Principal** | View and review (approve/reject) attendance reports, notify teachers |
| **Teacher** | View notifications sent by the principal about their students |
| **Student** | View their own memberships and attendance (read-only) |

---

## 4. Data Models (Database Schema)

### 4.1 `sports_activities`
The master list of all extracurricular groups.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | INT PK | Auto-increment |
| `name` | VARCHAR | e.g. "Football Team" |
| `type` | ENUM | [Sport](file:///d:/UNI%20Projects/EduTrack/backend/src/models/SportActivity.ts#4-11), `Club`, `Society` |
| `in_charge_staff_id` | INT | FK → Staff/User |
| `description` | TEXT | Optional |

---

### 4.2 `sports_memberships`
Links students to activities with enriched details.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | INT PK | |
| `student_id` | INT | FK → Student |
| `student_name` | VARCHAR | Denormalized for reporting |
| `activity_id` | INT | FK → `sports_activities` |
| `role` | ENUM | [Member](file:///d:/UNI%20Projects/EduTrack/frontend/src/services/api.ts#29-36), `Captain`, `Vice-Captain`, `President`, `Secretary`, `Treasurer` |
| `grade` | VARCHAR | Student's class/grade |
| `class_teacher_name` | VARCHAR | Stored at time of registration |
| `joined_at` | DATE | |
| `quit_at` | DATE NULL | `NULL` = active member |

---

### 4.3 `sports_practice_sessions`
Timetabled practice events run by a coach.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | INT PK | |
| `activity_id` | INT | FK → `sports_activities` |
| `coach_id` | INT | FK → Staff/User |
| `start_time` | DATETIME | ISO datetime |
| `end_time` | DATETIME | |
| `location_id` | INT NULL | FK → `sports_facilities` |

---

### 4.4 `sports_attendance`
Per-student, per-session attendance records.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | INT PK | |
| `session_id` | INT | FK → `sports_practice_sessions` |
| `student_id` | INT | |
| `status` | ENUM | `Present`, `Absent`, `Excused`, `Late` |
| `recorded_at` | TIMESTAMP | Auto |

> **Upsert logic:** If a record already exists for a student-session pair, it is **updated** rather than duplicated.

---

### 4.5 `sports_attendance_reports`
Daily summary reports generated by coaches and reviewed by the principal.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | INT PK | |
| `activity_id` | INT | |
| `coach_id` | INT | |
| `report_date` | DATE | |
| `total_students`, `present_count`, `absent_count`, `late_count`, `excused_count` | INT | Auto-computed from attendance DB |
| `report_details` | JSON | Full per-student breakdown (name, grade, teacher) |
| `status` | ENUM | `Pending` → `Approved` / `Rejected` |
| `submitted_at`, `reviewed_at`, `reviewed_by` | TIMESTAMP/INT | Audit trail |

---

### 4.6 `sports_teacher_notifications`
Notifications sent from the principal to class teachers after a report is approved.

| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | INT PK | |
| `report_id` | INT | FK → `sports_attendance_reports` |
| `teacher_id` | INT | Target teacher's ID |
| `message` | TEXT | Custom notification message |
| `status` | ENUM | `Unread`, `Read`, [Actioned](file:///d:/UNI%20Projects/EduTrack/backend/src/models/AttendanceReport.ts#122-128) |
| `sent_at` | TIMESTAMP | |

---

### 4.7 `sports_facilities` & `sports_bookings`
Physical venues that can be booked for practice sessions.

| Key Fields | Notes |
|---|---|
| Facility: `name`, `type` (Ground/Room/Hall/Court/Pool), `capacity` | Master list of venues |
| Booking: `facility_id`, `booked_by_id`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `status` | **Conflict detection** built in |

---

### 4.8 `sports_inventory` & `sports_inventory_logs`
Equipment stock management.

| Key Fields | Notes |
|---|---|
| Item: `name`, `category`, `total_quantity`, `available_quantity`, `condition` | Tracks stock levels |
| Log: `item_id`, `borrowed_by_id`, `status` | Tracks borrow/return/lost/damaged |

> **Availability check:** [borrowItem()](file:///d:/UNI%20Projects/EduTrack/backend/src/models/Inventory.ts#69-91) atomically decrements `available_quantity` and rejects if stock is zero.

---

### 4.9 `sports_alerts`
System-generated or manual alerts for operational incidents.

| Field | Notes |
|---|---|
| `alert_type` | `Missing_Student`, `Equipment_Issue`, `Facility_Conflict`, `General` |
| `severity` | `Low`, `Medium`, `High`, `Critical` |
| `status` | `Pending` → `Acknowledged` → `Resolved` |

> **Auto-generation:** After marking session attendance, [checkMissingStudents()](file:///d:/UNI%20Projects/EduTrack/backend/src/models/Alert.ts#117-157) automatically creates `High`-severity alerts for any registered student who was not marked `Present`, `Late`, or `Excused`.

---

### 4.10 `sports_achievements` & `sports_matches`
Student achievement and match/competition tracking.

| Key Fields | Notes |
|---|---|
| Match: `activity_id`, [date](file:///d:/UNI%20Projects/EduTrack/backend/src/models/Alert.ts#105-112), `opponent`, `result` (Win/Loss/Draw/Upcoming), scores | Match history |
| Achievement: `student_id`, `title`, `merit_points`, `type` | Linked to students, activities, or matches |

> Provides a **Sports CV** per student: total merit points + achievement history + active memberships.

---

## 5. Backend API Endpoints

### Activities `/api/sports/activities`
| Method | Route | Role | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| GET | `/` | All | List all activities |
| POST | `/` | Admin, Coach | Create new activity |
| DELETE | `/:id` | Admin | Delete activity |

### Memberships `/api/sports/memberships`
| Method | Route | Role | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/register` | Admin, Coach | Register student to activity (with grade + teacher) |
| GET | `/activity/:activityId` | All | Get all members of an activity |
| GET | `/student/:studentId` | All | Get all activities a student is in |
| DELETE | `/:id` | Admin, Coach | Remove student (sets `quit_at`) |

### Attendance `/api/sports/attendance`
| Method | Route | Role | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/sessions` | Admin, Coach | Create practice session |
| GET | `/sessions` | All | List sessions (filterable by activity) |
| DELETE | `/sessions/:id` | Admin, Coach | Delete session |
| GET | `/session/:sessionId` | All | Get attendance for a session |
| POST | `/mark` | Admin, Coach | Mark one student's attendance |
| POST | `/mark-bulk` | Admin, Coach | Mark all students at once |

### Reports `/api/sports/reports`
| Method | Route | Role | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | `/` | Admin, Coach | **Auto-generate** report from attendance data |
| GET | `/` | Admin, Principal, Coach | List reports (filterable by status/coach/activity) |
| GET | `/:id` | All | Get full report details |
| PUT | `/:id/review` | Admin, Principal | Approve or Reject a report |
| POST | `/:id/notify-teacher` | Admin, Principal | Send notification to a teacher |
| GET | `/notifications/mine` | All | Get teacher's notifications |
| PUT | `/notifications/:id/action` | Admin, Teacher | Mark notification as actioned |

### Facilities, Inventory, Alerts, Achievements
Each follows standard CRUD patterns at their respective routes, with role-based authorization enforced at the route level.

