## 6. Frontend Pages (UI Flow)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    Login[LoginPage\nRole Selection] --> Activities

    subgraph Coach Workflow
        Activities[ActivitiesPage\nBrowse / Create Activities]
        Activities -->|View Members| Members[ActivityMembersPage\nSearch student, Register, Remove]
        Activities -->|Take Attendance| Attendance[AttendancePage\nCreate Session, Mark Attendance]
        Attendance -->|Generate Report| Report[AttendanceReportPage\nView submitted reports]
    end

    subgraph Principal Workflow
        Dashboard[PrincipalDashboard\nView Pending Reports, Approve/Reject\nNotify Teachers]
    end

    subgraph Teacher Workflow
        Notifs[TeacherNotificationsPage\nView alerts about their students\nMark as Actioned]
    end
```

### Page-by-Page Breakdown

| Page | Primary Users | Key Features |
|---|---|---|
| **LoginPage** | All | Mock role selector (Admin/Coach/Principal/Teacher) stored in `localStorage` |
| **ActivitiesPage** | Coach, Admin | Grid card view of all Sports/Clubs/Societies; Create modal; Delete (Admin) |
| **ActivityMembersPage** | Coach, Admin | Live student search by name; assign role + grade + class teacher; View/remove members list |
| **AttendancePage** | Coach | Create practice sessions with location; Select session; Mark each student Present/Absent/Excused/Late; Bulk mark |
| **AttendanceReportPage** | Coach | Select activity + date → auto-generate report from DB attendance data; View past report cards (sport name + date); Expandable detail table (per student: name, grade, class teacher, status) |
| **PrincipalDashboard** | Principal | Tabbed view: Pending/All reports; Clickable report cards with per-student detail table; Approve/Reject buttons; Notify Teacher form (sends notification to selected teacher) |
| **TeacherNotificationsPage** | Teacher | View all notifications with activity name, report date, summary stats; Mark as Actioned |

---

## 7. Key Workflows (End-to-End Data Flow)

### Workflow A: Student Registration
```
Coach → ActivitiesPage → ActivityMembersPage
  → Search student by name (GET /students/search)
  → Select role + fill grade + class teacher name
  → POST /memberships/register
  → Record stored in sports_memberships with full details
```

### Workflow B: Attendance Marking
```
Coach → AttendancePage
  → Create practice session (POST /attendance/sessions)
  → Select session → load registered members (GET /memberships/activity/:id)
  → Mark each student status
  → POST /attendance/mark-bulk → upserts into sports_attendance
```

### Workflow C: Report Generation & Approval
```
Coach → AttendanceReportPage
  → Select activity + date
  → POST /reports → Backend runs buildReportStats():
      SQL: JOIN sports_attendance + sports_practice_sessions + sports_memberships
      Returns: total/present/absent/late/excused counts + per-student details (name, grade, teacher)
  → Report saved to sports_attendance_reports with status=Pending

Principal → PrincipalDashboard
  → See Pending report card
  → Expand to view per-student detail table
  → Click Approve → PUT /reports/:id/review → status=Approved

Principal → Click "Notify Teacher"
  → POST /reports/:id/notify-teacher { teacher_id, message }
  → Record saved to sports_teacher_notifications

Teacher → TeacherNotificationsPage
  → GET /reports/notifications/mine → see notification
  → Click "Mark Actioned" → PUT /reports/notifications/:id/action
```

---

## 8. Notable Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Denormalized `student_name`, `grade`, `class_teacher_name` in memberships** | Preserves historical data at the time of registration — even if the student changes grade later, old reports remain accurate |
| **Auto-computed report stats from DB** | [buildReportStats()](file:///d:/UNI%20Projects/EduTrack/backend/src/models/AttendanceReport.ts#131-176) queries live attendance data rather than trusting user input, ensuring accuracy |
| **`quit_at` soft-delete for memberships** | Membership history is preserved; only `quit_at IS NULL` records are considered active |
| **Upsert for attendance records** | Prevents duplicate entries if a coach accidentally marks the same student twice |
| **Conflict detection for facility bookings** | Checks all overlapping time ranges in SQL before allowing a booking |
| **Header-based auth (mock)** | Designed for development/demo; can be swapped for JWT in production |
| **TanStack Query for frontend** | Handles caching, background refresh, and loading/error states without manual `useEffect` chains |

---

## 9. Database Tables Summary

| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `sports_activities` | Master activity registry |
| `sports_memberships` | Student ↔ Activity link with role + grade info |
| `sports_practice_sessions` | Timetabled training events |
| `sports_attendance` | Per-student status per session |
| `sports_attendance_reports` | Daily summary reports (Coach → Principal workflow) |
| `sports_teacher_notifications` | Notifications from Principal to Class Teachers |
| `sports_facilities` | Venue/location registry |
| `sports_bookings` | Facility booking with conflict detection |
| `sports_inventory` | Equipment stock tracking |
| `sports_inventory_logs` | Borrow/return/lost/damaged history |
| `sports_alerts` | Automatic + manual incident alerts |
| `sports_matches` | Competition history (Win/Loss/Draw) |
| `sports_achievements` | Student merit points and awards |
